message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "mowjsub"
abstract: >-
  Continuum subtraction tools for spectral-line radio astronomy data, operating
  either in the image plane on FITS spectral cubes or in the visibility plane on
  CASA Measurement Sets, with optional Doppler correction onto a chosen spectral
  frame.
type: software
